  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fish molee is a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "molee ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "molee"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "-style curry from Kerala's "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "syrian christian cooking",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "syrian-christian-cooking"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " tradition. The fish is added to the sauce and cooked by a gentle "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "shallow poach",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "shallow-poach"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " so it stays intact. Use a firm white fish that will not break apart easily."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Do not stir the fish once it is in the sauce. Baste it by spooning the liquid over the top and let it cook undisturbed."
          }
        ]
      },
